  "principles": [
    "Backend owns declared business facts and rules.",
    "Frontend interprets declarations and presents them without inventing missing semantics.",
    "Contract-aware business value presentation remains the semantic decision authority.",
    "Display formatting and semantic decision are separate responsibilities.",
    "Raw business values and field identity survive transport until final presentation.",
    "Different surfaces may use different density, but not different business meaning.",
    "Missing declarations fail closed and move to the owning P0 producer layer.",
    "No second value runtime, Renderer registry, Bundle or page engine is introduced."
  ],
